This repository also includes material from bergside/awesome-design-skills
(https://github.com/bergside/awesome-design-skills), commit
f631a09b4fcc0166f2e2c1a8c81906ef680c57e8: the 67 folders skills/style-*/
(SKILL.md and DESIGN.md each). Changes made: each folder was renamed with a
"style-" prefix and its SKILL.md `name` updated to match. Ten styles named
after brands or products were renamed, with brand names and brand-only fonts
removed from their text:
  - style-structured (was ant)
  - style-research-journal (was claude)
  - style-blank-canvas (was codex)
  - style-playful-rounded (was lingo)
  - style-layered (was material)
  - style-eight-bit (was pacman)
  - style-purple-dashboard (was roku)
  - style-arcade (was sega)
  - style-utility-mono (was shadcn)
  - style-blocks (was tetris)
